# Testing and verification

## Repo gates

| Command | When required |
|---------|---------------|
| `npm run verify` | Every change — lint + typecheck + unit tests |
| `npm run verify:all` | Builder UI interaction changes — adds Playwright e2e |
| `npm run setup:e2e` | Once per machine before first e2e run |

Do not propose work as ready if `verify` has not been run and passed.

## Test runners

| Area | Runner | Environment |
|------|--------|-------------|
| Runtime packages | Jest | jsdom (WC, React, Vue) or node (Angular, Svelte TS specs) |
| `packages/core` | Jest | node |
| Builder client | Jest | jsdom |
| E2E | Playwright | `apps/client-e2e/` (ports 4201/3001) |

Vitest is not used for runtime packages.

## Spec file naming

| Package | Pattern |
|---------|---------|
| web-components | `rd-{name}.spec.ts` co-located or adjacent |
| react | `{Name}.spec.tsx` or `{kebab}.spec.tsx` |
| angular | `{kebab}.spec.ts` |
| vue | `{kebab}.spec.ts` |
| svelte | `{kebab}.spec.ts` (tests TS module; Svelte render optional) |

Specs must assert at minimum: root `data-testid`, key prop reflection, and one interaction or event where applicable.

## Selector conventions

| Context | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Public npm components | `[data-testid="rd-chart-bar"]` — equals BEM root |
| Builder preview | `[data-testid="preview-…"]` |
| Builder UI | `[data-testid="…"]` — never CSS classes or visible text alone |
| Palette add button | `palette-add-{dotted.type}` e.g. `palette-add-visual.input.number` |

## New component definition of done

- [ ] `ComponentDefinition` + validation tests in `packages/core`
- [ ] Manifest entry in `tools/runtime-taxonomy/manifest.mjs`
- [ ] WC implementation + unit spec
- [ ] Codegen / CE-host for React, Angular, Vue, Svelte + unit spec each
- [ ] Vanilla snippet documented (WC README)
- [ ] Storybook story in all five catalogs via `tools/storybook-shared/`
- [ ] React exporter minimum; all UI exporters when export matrix touched
- [ ] Taxonomy row in `docs/08-component-taxonomy.md` (or successor)
- [ ] Accessibility checklist in `13-accessibility.mdc`
- [ ] E2E or integration test: add → configure → preview (builder changes)
- [ ] `npm run verify` green

## Exporter tests

- Fixture dashboards in export matrix — wrong `ir.targets.ui` must fail
- Binding-heavy components covered in exporter specs
- Re-export same composite version → stable file paths (no random suffixes)
- Standalone output: no required `@rosettadash/*` import with default options

## Storybook quality

- Catalog stories: thin wrappers over `mountPaletteCatalog()` — do not fork catalog content per runtime
- Meta compositions: Controls + Actions + `play` functions for drill-down flows
- Component coverage audit story stays green (`docs/42-storybook-meta-compositions.md`)

## WC Jest setup

React/Vue specs reuse `packages/web-components/jest-setup.cjs` for CE registration. Register shadow-base CEs before mounting media components in tests.

